  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "There are mysteries to the Nightar I have recently discovered, though I fought tooth and nail for nearly twenty years to even gain enough trust to ask. I have elected to mark down the information for preservation. It will benefit us all to better understand this enigmatic people and their way of life away from sunlight the rest of us take for granted.",
    "value": "近日，我窥见了夜族的一些隐秘。尽管为此我几乎挣扎了二十年，才勉强赢得开口探问的信任。我决定将这些信息记录下来，以作保存。这将有助于我们更好地理解这一谜一般的族群，以及他们远离我们其他种族视为理所当然的阳光的生存之道。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "We non-Nightar have often wondered why the Fulgrat, despite being publicly referred to as their leader, has nothing whatsoever to do with territorial disputes, economics, trade or lawmaking...or any true requirements to keep a civilization going. The reason is simple:  The Fulgrat is their military General only. The true political pull among the Nightar comes from the females.",
    "value": "我们这些非夜族常感困惑：为何“拂格拉特”虽被公认为领袖，却与领土争端、经济、贸易、立法毫无关联...也不涉任何维系文明运转的真正事务？原因很简单：“拂格拉特”仅是他们的军事统帅。夜族真正的政治引力，源自女性。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "More specifically, from She, the Great Matriarch, Avemnedara, Mistress of the Way...many names are given to She that Rules. The womenfolk are the only ones permitted to speak of her, or even refer to her. Males who do so must be cleansed through ritual combat followed by Conshak, a 'transfer of energy' from Beyond and into the warrior.",
    "value": "更确切地说，源自“她”：伟大的女族长，阿瓦曼达拉，道之主...统治者的“她”拥有诸多尊称。唯有女性被允许谈论“她”，甚至提及“她”。男性若敢僭越，须经仪式性战斗净罪，并接受“交锋”，一种来自彼岸、注入战士体内的能量转移。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "How the current Matriarch is chosen is completely unknown, as the women would never tell a male such as myself how their most private sisterhood operates. They speak only that she is the Word, and the Guide, and that Her way is the true path. Through She, they are One. So long as ones fealty is sworn to Her the Burrow is safe. This seems to be sufficient explanation to them.",
    "value": "现任女族长如何选出，至今全然成谜。女性绝不会向我这样的男性透露她们最私密的姐妹团如何运作。她们只说她即“道”，即“指引”，她的道路是唯一真途。借由她，她们合为一体。只要宣誓效忠于她，族居之地便是安全的。对她们而言，这已是足够的解释。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "Any further pressing for information about this Matriarch is met with nothing but silence. I dare not press deeper, as the menfolk have been eyeing me up for the last several days. One faux-pas and I could find myself tossed into a duel I cannot possibly win with one of their highly skilled swordsmen.",
    "value": "若再追问女族长之事，唯有沉默以对。我不敢深究，因这几日已有男性族人紧盯我不放。稍有不慎，我便可能被卷入一场决斗，面对他们技艺高超的剑士，绝无胜算。"
